### 1. Imports (The Toolbox)

```tsx
// UI Primitives & Layout from the design system
import { RootLayout, VerticalStack, Heading, mdxComponents, ToAnchor, AnchorProvider, colors, PageLink, Text } from '@compiled/website-ui';

// MDX Rendering Context
