import { PageTitle } from './page-title';
import { ScrollTop } from './scroll-top';
import { LinkItem, Section } from './side-nav'; // Types for the sidebar data structure
```

**Key Imports:**
*   `require.context` (implicit global): Webpack API to import multiple files dynamically.
*   `mdxComponents`: Maps markdown elements (h1, code, table) to styled React components.
*   `AnchorProvider` / `ToAnchor`: Enable smooth scrolling to heading IDs (`#heading-id`).

